@startuml
title C16 visual-accessibility and mobile browser suites
' Traces: OMCT-C16-L2-03.02, OMCT-C16-L2-03.04
participant "Playwright runner" as Runner
participant "Visual-accessibility suite" as VisualSuite
participant "Mobile projects" as MobileProjects
participant "Browser page" as Page

Runner -> VisualSuite: run scenarios under e2e/tests/visual-a11y
activate VisualSuite
loop covered page or plugin scenario
  VisualSuite -> Page: execute visual and accessibility check
  activate Page
  Page --> VisualSuite: scenario result
  deactivate Page
end
VisualSuite --> Runner: suite result
deactivate VisualSuite

Runner -> MobileProjects: run iPad landscape and iPhone 14 Pro WebKit projects
activate MobileProjects
loop mobile smoke scenario
  MobileProjects -> Page: verify tree, search navigation, time conductor editing, or removal confirmation
  activate Page
  Page --> MobileProjects: scenario result
  deactivate Page
end
MobileProjects --> Runner: mobile result
deactivate MobileProjects
@enduml
